    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beginning at 5th level, whenever you use your <strong>Siphon Die</strong> on a hostile creature (such as via Deprive or Snare), you mark a severe vulnerability in its defense.</p><p>Once per turn, until the end of your next turn, the next weapon attack that hits that creature deals <strong>extra damage equal to 2 rolls of your Siphon Die</strong> (`2@scale.trader.siphon-die`).</p>"
